  "slug": "ultimate-cranberry-sauce",
  "name": "Ultimate Cranberry Sauce",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "This quick and easy cranberry sauce gets extra flavor from orange zest and fresh grated ginger.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine the sugar, orange zest and juice, and ginger in a pot over medium heat; cook and stir until the sugar is completely dissolved, about 5 minutes. Add the cranberries to the orange juice mixture; cook until the cranberries pop, about 5 minutes. Stir the pecans through the cranberry mixture; remove from heat and allow to cool completely before serving."
    }
  ],
